Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(post): name the move on an AC travel refusal

Preserve the input move index on AC path travel errors. Keep the typed
pose refusal as the cause so a post can find the move and its limit.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #3841
